---
// No props needed - static content
---

<section class="bg-bg-light px-5 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-24 gap-14">
    <div
        class="flex flex-row gap-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto items-center justify-between"
    >
        <div
            class="p-4 pb-18 max-w-1/3 shadow-[0_0.301094px_1.02372px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.02),0_1.14427px_3.89051px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0_5px_17px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]"
        >
            <img src="/about/happy-pic.webp" alt="Oleksii Zhuk" />
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-1/2">
            <h2
                class="mb-6 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-medium text-text-primary-inverse"
            >
                My story
            </h2>
            <div
                class="flex flex-col gap-4 leading leading-loose text-text-secondary-inverse"
            >
                <div
                    class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-stroke-medium text-lg leading-8 text-balance max-w-[50ch]"
                >
                    <p>
                        Since early childhood, I've enjoyed crafting useful
                        things with my grandpa in his workshop on a balcony. We
                        would devise ridiculous ideas tinkering with leftover
                        parts from old stuff. When I was home alone, I'd sit on
                        the floor building imaginary spaceships, racecars, and
                        robots from Lego parts.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Now I turn ideas into reality with companies and
                        startups from all around the world, and I can't imagine
                        my life without doing it.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
